nts. Her music often features themes of love, introspection, and personal growth, delivered with a soothing and emotive voice.","image":{"url":"https://images.qloo.com/i/345B890E-38F8-4E89-9CE6-A21201BA8893-420x-auto.jpg"}}},{"entity_id":"0B56A7A9-3438-41CF-B2A3-723FA85F1BB4","name":"HONNE","type":"urn:entity","subtype":"urn:entity:artist","popularity":0.9848711243929772,"affinity":0.9494258668631711,"properties":{"description":"Honne is a British electronic music duo formed by James Hatcher and Andy Clutterbuck. They are known for blending electronic music with soul and R&B influences, creating a smooth, synth-driven sound characterized by warm vocals and lush production. Their music often features themes of love, relationships, and emotional vulnerability, delivered with a modern yet nostalgic feel. Honne has gained a dedicated following for their emotive songwriting and polished electronic arrangements.","image":{"url":"https://images.qloo.com/i/0B56A7A9-3438-41CF-B2A3-723FA85F1BB4-420x-auto.jpg"}}},{"entity_id":"E57BFECF-236C-4B52-8B60-005709E3EE8F","name":"Johnny Stimson","type":"urn:entity","subtype":"urn:entity:artist","popularity":0.8970961209523622,"affinity":0.9477513345211491,"properties":{"description":"Johnny Stimson is an American singer-songwriter and musician known for his soulful voice and blend of pop, R&B, and indie influences. He has gained recognition for his emotive songwriting and smooth vocal delivery, often incorporating elements of blue-eyed soul and indie pop into his music.","image":{"url":"https://images.qloo.com/i/E57BFECF-236C-4B52-8B60-005709E3EE8F-420x-auto.jpg"}}},{"entity_id":"7AFC0B14-0285-457C-8C5B-30C1174E500E","name":"Jeff Bernat","type":"urn:entity","subtype":"urn:entity:artist","popularity":0.9109929287170111,"affinity":0.9465042944897506,"properties":{"description":"Jeff Bernat is a Filipino-American singer-songwriter and producer who gained recognition for his smooth, soulful voice and laid-back R&B style. He blends elements of soul, pop, and jazz to create a mellow and intimate sound. Bernat's music often features acoustic instrumentation and heartfelt lyrics, appealing to fans of contemporary R&B and neo soul. He has built a dedicated fanbase through his independent releases and has been praised for his vocal delivery and songwriting skills.","image":{"url":"https://images.qloo.com/i/7AFC0B14-0285-457C-8C5B-30C1174E500E-420x-auto.jpg"}}},{"entity_id":"A8C5EA6D-BE89-4FE4-86F2-7C73EA6EFCC4","name":"Giselle","type":"urn:entity","subtype":"urn:entity:artist","popularity":0.9063923349651679,"affinity":0.9423978655156793,"properties":{"description":"Giselle (Hangul: 지젤) is a Japanese–Korean singer signed to SM Entertainment who debuted on November 17, 2020 as the main rapper and a vocalist of the K-pop girl group aespa. She is known for bilingual delivery, blending rap and melodic vocals within the group's futuristic, electronic-influenced pop concept.","image":{"url":"https://images.qloo.com/i/A8C5EA6D-BE89-4FE4-86F2-7C73EA6EFCC4-420x-auto.jpg"}}},{"entity_id":"0D85212C-DEA2-40A7-B2B4-19DBD210B650","name":"Jayesslee","type":"urn:entity","subtype":"urn:entity:artist","popularity":0.9013657603103762,"affinity":0.941054382503844,"properties":{"description":"Jayesslee is a musical duo composed of sisters Janice and Sonia Lee, known for their harmonious pop and acoustic folk music. They gained popularity through their YouTube channel where they posted cover songs and original music, attracting a global audience. Their style blends soft pop melodies with acoustic instrumentation, often featuring heartfelt lyrics and vocal harmonies.","image":{"url":"https://images.qloo.com/i/0D85212C-DEA2-40A7-B2B4-19DBD210B650-420x-auto.jpg"}}}],"result_count":6,"provenance":{"source":"Qloo API","endpoint":"/v2/insights","documentation":"https://docs.qloo.com/reference/insights-api-deep-dive","requests":[{"method":"GET","path":"/v2/insights","query":{"filter.type":"urn:entity:artist","filter.results.entities"